index 000000000..972249913
--- /dev/null
+++ b/news/bulk_charge_errors.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+**Added:**
+
+* ``raise_errors`` argument added to ``bulk_assign_partial_charges`` method to allow to skip raising an ``ExceptionGroup`` with the details of any molecules which fail to have partial charges assigned, by default this is set to ``True`` to maintain the previous behavior.
+
+**Changed:**
+
+* The ``bulk_assign_partial_charges`` method now raises an ``ExceptionGroup`` with the details of any molecules which fail
+  to have partial charges assigned.
+
+**Deprecated:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Removed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Fixed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Security:**
+
+* <news item>
